    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonehold</strong> is a <strong>3D roguelike dungeon crawler</strong> with <strong>ARPG</strong> and <strong>hack-and-slash</strong> elements, blending fast-paced combat with strategic exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>7 unique character classes</strong>, including the <strong>Knight</strong>, <strong>Barbarian</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Scorcher</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Spellblade,</strong> and more, each offering distinct playstyles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Bonehold\u2019s ancient fortress, battling hordes of skeletons, ghosts, and magical abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>procedurally generated treasure</strong>s like weapons, spells, and armor, allowing endless possibilities for custom builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s striking art style combines <strong>hand-painted textures with pixel art</strong>, creating a visually stunning and immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the brave and skilled will conquer Bonehold\u2019s depths\u2014are you ready?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonehold</strong> is a <strong>3D roguelike dungeon crawler</strong> with <strong>ARPG</strong> and <strong>hack-and-slash</strong> elements, blending fast-paced combat with strategic exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>7 unique character classes</strong>, including the <strong>Knight</strong>, <strong>Barbarian</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Scorcher</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Spellblade,</strong> and more, each offering distinct playstyles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/03e85e61201175c06d733d7b059cbf61.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Bonehold\u2019s ancient fortress, battling hordes of skeletons, ghosts, and magical abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/b8bd510e5364e634d6b78fa8a1e6e5f6.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>procedurally generated treasure</strong>s like weapons, spells, and armor, allowing endless possibilities for custom builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.poster.avif?t=1752075743\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.webm?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497800/extras/27a947e3e48f7750644d97ddd64b67dd.mp4?t=1752075743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s striking art style combines <strong>hand-painted textures with pixel art</strong>, creating a visually stunning and immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the brave and skilled will conquer Bonehold\u2019s depths\u2014are you ready?</p>",
